{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/105d0f74182e44ca554c947e7dbd3fe4.poster.avif?t=1767839197\" width=780 height=321 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/105d0f74182e44ca554c947e7dbd3fe4.webm?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...this\u00a0is\u00a0<strong>Everything I Know, and Everything I'm Ever Gonna Know</strong>, a small modern visual novel about the hardships of young adulthood, failed relationships, and baseball(?!?) in the modern world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Icarus!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/664a45ae3ecfa9d5a89ac7ecf30533f2.poster.avif?t=1767839197\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/664a45ae3ecfa9d5a89ac7ecf30533f2.webm?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/664a45ae3ecfa9d5a89ac7ecf30533f2.mp4?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icarus, our lasagna loving hero, finds himself on a chunk of land that has mysteriously floated away from earth, stranding he and a cast of varied individuals who must pause their lives for a brief period of romance and rumination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play ball..</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/14c33281bf9a0a63354f78fc72c7055a.poster.avif?t=1767839197\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/14c33281bf9a0a63354f78fc72c7055a.webm?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/14c33281bf9a0a63354f78fc72c7055a.mp4?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you perform in baseball determines the confidence level of your avatar, Icarus, allowing alternative exploration of the subject matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry! This novel will give you the leniency to improve:)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >..with playing cards???</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/58232cf5d1c8c13ee16af1db601111be.poster.avif?t=1767839197\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/58232cf5d1c8c13ee16af1db601111be.webm?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/58232cf5d1c8c13ee16af1db601111be.mp4?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If baseball is causing you to struggle, you can update your deck of modifier cards, as these will allow affect various parameters in the mini game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Abominable Piggy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/e7991ee742c18432bf8b3232d5d37faa.poster.avif?t=1767839197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/e7991ee742c18432bf8b3232d5d37faa.webm?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a hideous, horrible pig in this novel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Mechanics!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/a721b384a888b4d6fa84273e2ac6def1.poster.avif?t=1767839197\" width=780 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/a721b384a888b4d6fa84273e2ac6def1.webm?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/a721b384a888b4d6fa84273e2ac6def1.mp4?t=1767839197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While reading text <u>will</u> be your primary interaction, <strong>Everything I Know, and Everything I'm Ever Gonna Know </strong>is still mechanically dynamic. The mechanics you see on this page will be supplemented with additional surprises for those who look (and for those who don't as well, I suppose.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eclectic Characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/9856419e23239e01d606143c9b6f6bc3.webp?t=1767839197\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/9856419e23239e01d606143c9b6f6bc3.poster.avif?t=1767839197\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=1389 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extras/aa47f32cfae1e92aab200c4d3bb10f80.webp?t=1767839197\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865550/extra